e in society any kind of  racism in has to be dealt with it has to  be investigated I had a long meeting  with a group of women in my constituency  Muslim women who told me the levels of  abuse they receive on the buses and  trains Transport for London are dealing  with that because I've asked them to  exactly the same applies to anybody else  Jewish women or Jewish men if they're  abused on the street deserve exactly the  same protection as everybody else we  have to recognize we are a multi-faith  multicultural multi-ethnic society and  behave with decency and respect and  inclusivity towards everyone and that is  exactly what I'm doing as leader of the  party that's exactly what the Labour  Party stands for we're the party that  introduced the first race relations act  we're the party that introduced the  Human Rights Act we're the party they  introduced the equalities act we're the  party that stands up for that decent  inclusive society that we all want to  live in but mr. Cole when you find  yourself having to state that here on  Sky News this morning why isn't  message getting through why is one of  your labor peers having to ask that  question you have got internal  investigations going on within the Labor  Party as to some of your members I use  the example of Vicki Kirby it was  excluded from the party over  anti-semitism then including the party  then excluded again them back in why  isn't this trickling through the Labour  Party ranks it is very much through the  labour party ranks it's something that's  fully understood throughout the labour  party fully understood and we do take  action on the very very very small  number of cases where anything happens  and if we hear any allegations they are  properly and thoroughly investigated  this is a party that stands up for all  the things that we as a society  absolutely believe in and if there are  complaints of anybody has then they will  be investigated as they are being  investigated at the present time b